{"seq":1,"slug":"promise-accuracy-metrics","title":"承诺准确性度量：PD/PT 达成率与破损过期分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-accuracy-metrics","wordCount":3203,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"承诺准确性度量-pd-pt-达成率与破损过期分析\">承诺准确性度量：PD/PT 达成率与破损过期分析</h1><p>订单承诺引擎自己也有一份待兑现的承诺。当引擎对买家说出「3 月 14 日送达」，这句话在下单那刻就成了一份可事后检验的契约；若没人系统化度量「说出的日期与实际的日期差了多少、错在谁身上」，承诺引擎就只是一个把不确定性推给客服的黑盒。本文处理这条闭环的度量层：PD/PT 两个时间锚点怎么定义、破损与过期怎么量化、如何把指标拆回承诺链路的每一段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-pd-与-pt-是两个不同的承诺基准\">核心概念：PD 与 PT 是两个不同的承诺基准</h2><p>**PD（Promise Date，承诺送达日）**是对买家说的话，单位是「日」，容差通常 ±1 天。<strong>PT（Promise Time，承诺时点）<strong>是对履约链内部说的话——最晚拣货完成、最晚交承运商（hand-off cutoff）、最晚报关放行，单位是「小时」，通常零容忍，因为错过承运商当日截单就只能顺延一整天。二者不是同一指标的粗细粒度，而是</strong>两个独立的服务对象</strong>：PD 度量买家体验，PT 度量内部协同纪律。引擎完全可能 PT 达成率 97% 而 PD 达成率只有 88%——干线或末端把 PT 省下的时间又吃掉了。</p>\n<p>度量的第一原则是<strong>在下单时刻冻结承诺快照</strong>：若只记录订单当前最新的承诺日期，任何一次改期都会覆盖历史承诺，达成率永远算不准。工程做法是单独一张 promise snapshot 表 <code>(order_id, promise_version, pd, pt, frozen_at, reason)</code>，首次承诺 <code>version=1</code>，每次改期追加一行，由此派生<strong>首次承诺达成率</strong>（承诺质量）、<strong>最终承诺达成率</strong>（交付能力，因末次改期往往已贴近实际而天然偏高）与<strong>改期次数分布</strong>（promise churn，稳定性）。</p>\n<p>两种「达成」必须严格区分，否则指标会自欺。记实际值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>、承诺值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、容差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>命中率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>准确率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>ϵ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><mi>N</mi></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>Bias</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>N</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{命中率} = \\frac{\\#\\{a \\le p\\}}{N}, \\qquad \\text{准确率} = \\frac{\\#\\{|a - p| \\le \\epsilon\\}}{N}, \\qquad \\text{Bias} = \\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(a_i - p_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">命中率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">准确率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bias</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>命中率<strong>单侧</strong>（早到不算失败），准确率<strong>双侧</strong>（早到太多也失败，它压垮波次编排与收货人力）。Bias 为负说明引擎<strong>过度保守</strong>（承诺比实际晚、达成率虚高，代价是把可赢的转化率让给对手），为正说明<strong>系统性激进</strong>（达成率会崩）。健康的引擎应当 Bias 近似 0、P90 绝对误差落进容差。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>口径</th>\n<th>服务对象</th>\n<th>健康信号</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PD 命中率</td>\n<td>实际签收日 ≤ 首次承诺日</td>\n<td>买家</td>\n<td>≥ 95%，Bias ∈ [-0.5, +0.2] 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PD 准确率</td>\n<td>绝对误差 ≤ 1 天</td>\n<td>买家 + 成本</td>\n<td>≥ 90%（双侧，抑制过度提前）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PT 达成率</td>\n<td>实际交承运商时点 ≤ 截单时点</td>\n<td>仓内 / 协同</td>\n<td>≥ 97%，零容忍桶单列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺改期率</td>\n<td>至少改期一次的订单占比</td>\n<td>稳定性</td>\n<td>≤ 5%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>完美订单率</td>\n<td>时间 × 数量 × 完好 × 单证</td>\n<td>综合</td>\n<td>见下节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"pd-达成率-面向买家的承诺交期度量\">PD 达成率：面向买家的承诺交期度量</h2><p>PD 达成率最容易被口径问题做坏，根子在<strong>分母与「谁说了算」</strong>。行业通行的 DIFOT（Delivery In Full, On Time，亦称 OTIF）要求同时满足正确的商品与质量、订购的数量、约定的地点与约定的时间（可带容差），计算式为 <code>OTIF(%) = OTIF 交付数 ÷ 总交付数 × 100</code>；英国零售领先实践把 OTIF 目标定在 <strong>SKU 粒度上超过 97%</strong>（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DIFOT\">DIFOT / OTIF，Wikipedia</a>）。这条定义埋着两个坑：其一，<strong>统计层级必须声明</strong>——按订单、按订单行还是按件，差异巨大（20 行订单漏发一行，订单级算失败、件级只损失 5%）；其二，<strong>「承诺日 vs 请求日」必须分清</strong>——同一批货可能对供应商的承诺日达标，却对买家的原始请求日超期。</p>\n<p>第二个坑是<strong>改期污染达成率</strong>：跨境链路改期极频繁（港口拥堵、航班改配、买家改址、海关查验），若只算最终承诺，达成率会好看得毫无意义。正确做法是<strong>双轨上报</strong>——首次承诺达成率作「承诺引擎质量」的北极星指标，最终承诺达成率作「履约执行质量」的运营指标。第三个坑是<strong>时间戳口径</strong>：必须以<strong>买家可感知的签收事件</strong>（POD，proof of delivery）为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span></span>，且统一到买家本地时区（仓内时间戳多为 UTC，跨日边界订单会差一天）；不同承运商对「准时」的定义不同（首扫 vs 妥投），故承运商维度必须独立切片。</p>\n<p><strong>承诺本身的错误必须被度量，而不是被甩给执行</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>失败类别</th>\n<th>时间戳锚点</th>\n<th>归属责任</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>仓内延迟</td>\n<td>拣货完成 vs 波次计划</td>\n<td>仓储运营</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截单迟到</td>\n<td>交承运商 vs 当日截单</td>\n<td>仓内 + 承诺引擎 PT 压力</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>干线 / 清关</td>\n<td>离港放行 vs 计划</td>\n<td>物流/货代 + 关务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>末端派送</td>\n<td>妥投 vs 计划</td>\n<td>末端承运商</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>承诺本身有误</td>\n<td>首次承诺 vs 实际可达</td>\n<td><strong>承诺引擎自身</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若「各段全部达标、PD 仍然失败」占比很高，那是引擎在承诺计算时用了过于乐观的时长分布（例如只取 P50 而非 P90），这是最需要回传给<a href=\"../atp-ctp-promise-model/promise-date-computation-model\">承诺日期计算模型</a>的信号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pt-达成率-面向履约链的承诺时点度量\">PT 达成率：面向履约链的承诺时点度量</h2><p>PT 度量「内部每个工序是否守住截止时点」。PT 容差通常是<strong>零</strong>，因为下游是硬边界：承运商每天有固定截单时间，错过就顺延一整天；报关有当日受理截止，跨境航班装板也有刚性截止。因此 PT 应按<strong>桶（bucket）的守约率</strong>——把「距截单剩余分钟数」分档，分别统计各档失败率：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>距截单余量</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>目标守约率</th>\n<th>失败后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&gt; 120 min</td>\n<td>从容</td>\n<td>≥ 99.5%</td>\n<td>异常，多为系统问题</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30–120 min</td>\n<td>正常</td>\n<td>≥ 98%</td>\n<td>顺延风险低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0–30 min</td>\n<td>紧张</td>\n<td>≥ 95%</td>\n<td>需人工兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&lt; 0（已过截单）</td>\n<td>超时</td>\n<td>视为失败</td>\n<td>必然顺延一天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>PT 失败高度集中在临界的 30 分钟窗口内</strong>。仓内作业时长分布的尾部很厚（缺货寻货、复核退回、称重异常），只要波次规划把完工时点排到截单前 20 分钟，尾部就会频繁越界。因此 PT 改进手段是<strong>在承诺 PT 与截单时间之间强制留出安全缓冲</strong>，并用「缓冲被击穿率」作早期预警。另外，<strong>PT 与 PD 之间隔着一段引擎无法承诺、却必须承担的时间</strong>：PT 达标只保证货按时交给承运商，不保证它穿过清关与末端。工程上把这条链显式拆段度量，让 <strong>PT 与 PD 达成率的差值</strong>成为独立诊断量——差值长期为正，说明下游某段在系统性吃掉上游攒下的缓冲；库存侧导致的 PT 失败要回到<a href=\"../inventory-supply-availability/inventory-sync-consistency-lag\">库存同步一致性</a>去治。</p>\n<h2 id=\"破损与过期-时间之外的质量类承诺失败\">破损与过期：时间之外的质量类承诺失败</h2><p><strong>准时到达的破损商品在时间指标上完全合格，在体验上是彻底失败</strong>。完美订单（Perfect Order）把承诺拆成可乘的维度，任一失败则整单不算完美：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>perfect</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>on-time</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>in-full</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>undamaged</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>unexpired</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>doc-accurate</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{perfect}} = P_{\\text{on-time}} \\times P_{\\text{in-full}} \\times P_{\\text{undamaged}} \\times P_{\\text{unexpired}} \\times P_{\\text{doc-accurate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">perfect</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">on-time</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">in-full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">undamaged</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">unexpired</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">doc-accurate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>五个各自 97% 的维度相乘只剩约 86%</strong>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.97</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.859</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.97^5 \\approx 0.859</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.859</span></span></span></span></span>）——这就是为什么顶级零售商 OTIF 要求看似只差 2-3 个百分点，达标难度却是量级差异。SCOR 模型把这组维度组织为可靠性指标族（完美订单履行 RL.1.x 及其分量），「交付绩效」的标准口径是「按承诺日期准时且完整交付的产品数」（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supply_chain_operations_reference\">Supply chain operations reference，Wikipedia</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>破损度量</strong>必须按段归因：跨境订单平均经过 4-7 次分拣转运，破损率与转运段数近似线性相关，故按段归因（出库→干线→转运→清关搬移→末端）才有改进价值。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>破损率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>破损件数</mtext><mtext>总交付件数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{破损率} = \\frac{\\text{破损件数}}{\\text{总交付件数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">破损率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总交付件数</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">破损件数</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只数件数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>赔付率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>破损理赔金额</mtext><mtext>该品类 GMV</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{赔付率} = \\frac{\\text{破损理赔金额}}{\\text{该品类 GMV}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">赔付率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2173em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8723em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">该品类</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"> GMV</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">破损理赔金额</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 才折算严重程度，故加固投入应按赔付额而非件数排序。</p>\n<p><strong>过期度量</strong>是跨境备货模式（海外仓、FBA）的隐蔽杀手：一批货运抵海外仓时，其<strong>剩余保质期</strong>已被海运与在库停留吃掉一大截，若采购与补货不把效期当约束，就会出现「货到了、时间也准、但剩余效期已低于平台上架门槛」。上架门槛随品类与政策变动（须以后台当期公告为准），低于门槛即不可售，实质是一次承诺失败，故该约束必须提前进入承诺引擎：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mtext>可承诺量</mtext><mtext>shelf-life</mtext></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">#</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>库存单位</mtext><mo>∣</mo><mtext>到货日</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>履约</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>承诺窗口</mtext></msub><mo>≤</mo><mtext>有效期</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可承诺量}^{\\text{shelf-life}} = \\#\\{\\text{库存单位} \\mid \\text{到货日} + T_{\\text{履约}} + T_{\\text{承诺窗口}} \\le \\text{有效期}\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可承诺量</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9223em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1362em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">shelf-life</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">#</span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">库存单位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">到货日</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">履约</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">承诺窗口</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效期</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，即<strong>效期是一种必须计入 ATP 的可用量约束</strong>。破损与过期最终还会以退货、差评、纠纷转化为平台账户健康的订单缺陷率（ODR）上升，长期超标会触发账户停用——亚马逊卖家绩效长期追踪 ODR（低于 1%）、发货前取消率（低于 2.5%）、晚发率（低于 4%）与有效追踪率（不低于 95%），阈值以 <a href=\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com/help/hub/reference/G200205250\">Amazon Seller Central 账户健康政策页</a> 当期口径为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可观测性管线与归因-从指标到根因\">可观测性管线与归因：从指标到根因</h2><p>度量要成立，需要一条<strong>不可变的事件管线</strong>，核心是三类数据源对齐：<strong>承诺快照</strong>（下单时冻结的 PD/PT，带版本）、<strong>履约事件流</strong>（WMS 拣货完成、TMS 交承运商、报关放行、干线离到港、末端扫描、POD 签收）、<strong>结果事实</strong>（是否按时、完整、破损、剩余效期）。连接键是 <code>order_id</code> + <code>line_id</code>，且必须处理<strong>迟到事件</strong>——跨境轨迹补报延迟可达数天，故指标要区分<strong>实时口径</strong>（运营当班盯盘，允许后续修正）与<strong>结算口径</strong>（绩效考核与罚款申诉，补报完成后定稿，通常 T+N 日冻结）。</p>\n<p>归因的基本方法是<strong>把 PD 误差分解为各段时长误差之和</strong>：设承诺链路有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 段，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 段计划时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{T}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0968em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、实际时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a - p = \\sum_{k=1}^{m} (T_k - \\hat{T}_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。这段分解能区分<strong>两类根本不同的失败</strong>：<strong>执行失败</strong>（某段实际时长显著超出自身历史分布，是运营异常）与<strong>模型失败</strong>（各段时长都在正常范围，但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum \\hat{T}_k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从一开始就偏乐观，是承诺模型用了错误分位数）——前者修运营，后者修模型分位数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[在线指标: 当日 PD/PT 达成] --&gt; B[按承运商/线路/品类切片]&#10;    B --&gt; C{某切片显著劣化?}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[例行记录]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E[拉取该切片承诺误差分解]&#10;    E --&gt; F{误差集中在单段?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[执行失败 → 通知运营/承运商]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[模型失败 → 重估该链路时长分位数]&#10;    G --&gt; J[复盘写入归因库]&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt; K[回传承诺引擎参数]\">flowchart TD\n    A[在线指标: 当日 PD/PT 达成] --&gt; B[按承运商/线路/品类切片]\n    B --&gt; C{某切片显著劣化?}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[例行记录]\n    C --&gt;|是| E[拉取该切片承诺误差分解]\n    E --&gt; F{误差集中在单段?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[执行失败 → 通知运营/承运商]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[模型失败 → 重估该链路时长分位数]\n    G --&gt; J[复盘写入归因库]\n    H --&gt; J\n    J --&gt; K[回传承诺引擎参数]</pre><p>监控层还需一条纪律：<strong>指标必须能回答「如果现在改承诺策略会怎样」</strong>，因此除事后达成率外应常备一组<strong>前瞻型指标</strong>——分位数档位（P50/P90 占比）、缓冲击穿率、改期率趋势、效期余量分布。事后达成率永远滞后一个交付周期（跨境可达 15-30 天），等它报警时损失已成事实；前瞻型指标能在承诺发出当天暴露引擎在变激进还是保守。这与 <a href=\"../ctp-capacity-capable-promise/ctp-feasibility-solver\">CTP 可行性求解</a> 中「近似只能保守不能激进」是同一条纪律的度量侧投影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>承诺准确性度量是承诺引擎的反馈回路——没有它，引擎无法知道自己说过的日期是否兑现。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PD/PT 是两个独立基准</strong>：PD 面向买家的送达承诺（日粒度，单侧命中 + 双侧准确），PT 面向履约链的截止时点（小时粒度，零容忍，按余量分桶考核）。</li>\n<li><strong>必须冻结承诺快照</strong>并区分首次/最终承诺达成率；只说最终达成率等于自欺。</li>\n<li><strong>Bias 与准确率比命中率更能反映引擎质量</strong>：靠拉长承诺刷命中率会以转化率为代价。</li>\n<li><strong>破损与过期是时间之外的两类失败</strong>，完美订单按维度相乘（五个 97% 只剩约 86%），效期必须作为 ATP 的可用量约束提前进模型。</li>\n<li><strong>归因靠误差分解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>T</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mi>k</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a-p=\\sum(T_k-\\hat T_k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></strong>，据此区分执行失败与模型失败，并把结论回传承诺模型的分位数配置。</li>\n<li><strong>事后指标滞后一个交付周期</strong>，须配前瞻型指标当天兜底。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"参考资料\">参考资料</h2><ul>\n<li>DIFOT / OTIF 的定义、统计层级与英国零售领先实践目标：<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/DIFOT\">DIFOT，Wikipedia</a>。</li>\n<li>SCOR 可靠性指标族（完美订单履行及其分量）：ASCM/APICS《Supply Chain Operations Reference (SCOR) Digital Standard》；<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Supply_chain_operations_reference\">Supply chain operations reference，Wikipedia</a>。</li>\n<li>卖方绩效与账户健康阈值（以当期页为准）：<a href=\"https://sellercentral.amazon.com/help/hub/reference/G200205250\">Amazon Seller Central 账户健康政策页</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"承诺准确性度量：PD/PT 达成率与破损过期分析","id":"承诺准确性度量-pd-pt-达成率与破损过期分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：PD 与 PT 是两个不同的承诺基准","id":"核心概念-pd-与-pt-是两个不同的承诺基准"},{"level":2,"text":"PD 达成率：面向买家的承诺交期度量","id":"pd-达成率-面向买家的承诺交期度量"},{"level":2,"text":"PT 达成率：面向履约链的承诺时点度量","id":"pt-达成率-面向履约链的承诺时点度量"},{"level":2,"text":"破损与过期：时间之外的质量类承诺失败","id":"破损与过期-时间之外的质量类承诺失败"},{"level":2,"text":"可观测性管线与归因：从指标到根因","id":"可观测性管线与归因-从指标到根因"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考资料","id":"参考资料"}],"prev":{"title":"产能过载下的背压、限流与承诺降级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/ctp-capacity-capable-promise/capacity-overload-backpressure"},"next":{"title":"承诺异常与重承诺：缺货、延迟与改址触发的重排","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/order-promising-available-to-promise-engine/promise-operations-monitoring/promise-exception-replanning"}}